Iran security chief warns of ‘new surprises’ for US-Israeli enemy in any future attack 

Secretary of Iran’s Supreme National Security Council (SNSC) Major General Mohsen Rezaee has warned that the Islamic Revolution Guards Corps (IRGC) Aerospace Force is fully prepared to deliver “new surprises” on the battlefield in the event of another attack by the US-Israeli enemy.

