Israeli strike on Nasser Hospital in southern Gaza a war crime: Hamas 

Hamas has denounced an Israeli airstrike that killed six Palestinians and wounded more than 20 others at Nasser Medical Complex in southern Gaza as yet another war crime, urging the international community to fulfill its responsibility by taking concrete measures to help end the genocide.

@PressTV

IRGC: Two violating supertankers explode in Hormuz Strait after transiting unauthorized route 

The Islamic Revolution Guards Corps (IRGC) Navy says two supertankers, carrying a total of more than 4 million barrels of oil, have suffered massive explosions and were disabled in the Strait of Hormuz after ignoring repeated warnings against using an unauthorized and unsafe southern shipping route.

